      "text": "made up in the form of a cake. Var. dial.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04372394366197183,
        "y0": 0.4570362068965518,
        "x1": 0.4194169014084507,
        "y1": 0.48558620689655174
      },
      "text": "TALLOW-CATCH. Same as Keech (2). TALLOW-CRAPS. See Craps (1).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04331830985915493,
        "y0": 0.48347241379310346,
        "x1": 0.474887323943662,
        "y1": 0.4985775862068965
      },
      "text": "TALLOW-HUED. Pale as tallow. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0663943661971831,
        "y0": 0.5001224137931035,
        "x1": 0.38582535211267605,
        "y1": 0.5115931034482759
      },
      "text": "Burton uses the phrase tallow-faced.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04331830985915493,
        "y0": 0.5111206896551723,
        "x1": 0.4744788732394366,
        "y1": 0.5257793103448276
      },
      "text": "TALLOW-LAFE. Congiarium, MS. Diet. c.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06598873239436619,
        "y0": 0.5276741379310345,
        "x1": 0.11295492957746478,
        "y1": 0.5377827586206896
      },
      "text": "1500.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04291267605633803,
        "y0": 0.5379120689655172,
        "x1": 0.47447605633802814,
        "y1": 0.5526517241379311
      },
      "text": "TALL-WOOD. \" Tall woode, pacta wodde to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06518028169014084,
        "y0": 0.5525913793103447,
        "x1": 0.4744788732394366,
        "y1": 0.5662448275862069
      },
      "text": "make byllettes of, taillee\" Palsgrave. The",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06518028169014084,
        "y0": 0.5671362068965518,
        "x1": 0.29594647887323944,
        "y1": 0.5787310344827585
      },
      "text": "term is still used in Kent.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04372394366197183,
        "y0": 0.5780189655172414,
        "x1": 0.4744788732394366,
        "y1": 0.5932672413793103
      },
      "text": "TALLY. (1) A terra in playing ball, when the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06558591549295775,
        "y0": 0.5933413793103448,
        "x1": 0.4736732394366197,
        "y1": 0.6062741379310346
      },
      "text": "number of aces on both sides is equal. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04453239436619718,
        "y0": 0.6068586206896551,
        "x1": 0.4404676056338029,
        "y1": 0.6201120689655173
      },
      "text": "(2) To reckon. See Becon's Works, p. 134.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04412676056338028,
        "y0": 0.6216948275862069,
        "x1": 0.47609859154929574,
        "y1": 0.6994275862068966
      },
      "text": "(3) In counting any articles which are sold by the hundred, bne is thrown out after each hundred ; that is called the tally. The number of tallies of course shows the number of hundreds. They are given in to the purchaser. Hunter.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04453239436619718,
        "y0": 0.6983620689655172,
        "x1": 0.26800845070422535,
        "y1": 0.7140465517241379
      },
      "text": "(4 ) A kind ofsmall ship.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04412676056338028,
        "y0": 0.7124068965517241,
        "x1": 0.4732647887323943,
        "y1": 0.739703448275862
      },
      "text": "(5) A company or division of voters at an election. Somerset.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04412676056338028,
        "y0": 0.7429689655172413,
        "x1": 0.22266197183098593,
        "y1": 0.7538448275862069
      },
      "text": "(6) Stoutly ; boldly.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04412676056338028,
        "y0": 0.7552637931034483,
        "x1": 0.14291549295774647,
        "y1": 0.7674741379310345
      },
      "text": "(7) Seemly",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1493887323943662,
        "y0": 0.7567431034482759,
        "x1": 0.34048169014084506,
        "y1": 0.7669913793103448
      },
      "text": "; decently ; elegantlv.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04331830985915493,
        "y0": 0.7661275862068966,
        "x1": 0.31010985915492956,
        "y1": 0.781348275862069
      },
      "text": "TALME. To becom'e dumb .'",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10283098591549296,
        "y0": 0.7803724137931034,
        "x1": 0.397969014084507,
        "y1": 0.8047068965517241
      },
      "text": "Hur fadur nere-hande can talme, Soche a sweme hys harte can swalme.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.23602535211267606,
        "y0": 0.8060137931034483,
        "x1": 0.4740732394366197,
        "y1": 0.8177068965517241
      },
      "text": "J^ Bone Florence of Rome, 7G9.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06477464788732394,
        "y0": 0.817096551724138,
        "x1": 0.3951267605633803,
        "y1": 0.8285793103448276
      },
      "text": "I donke upon David, til mi tonge talrties ;",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06477464788732394,
        "y0": 0.8293,
        "x1": 0.42144788732394367,
        "y1": 0.8409586206896552
      },
      "text": "I ne rendrede nowt. si ihen men beren palmes",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06396619718309858,
        "y0": 0.8418465517241379,
        "x1": 0.43034929577464787,
        "y1": 0.8526982758620689
      },
      "text": "Is it also mlkel sorwe. in song so is in salmes ?",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3275183098591549,
        "y0": 0.8562137931034483,
        "x1": 0.47407042253521126,
        "y1": 0.8646327586206897
      },
      "text": "Reliq. Antiq. i. 292.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04453239436619718,
        "y0": 0.863548275862069,
        "x1": 0.47326197183098595,
        "y1": 0.8785879310344827
      },
      "text": "TALSHIDES. \" One pound of white lights, ten",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0672056338028169,
        "y0": 0.8804344827586207,
        "x1": 0.47447605633802814,
        "y1": 0.8921844827586207
      },
      "text": "talshides, eight faggotts,\" Ord. and Reg.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4935070422535211,
        "y0": 0.8878448275862069,
        "x1": 0.9250732394366198,
        "y1": 0.9166775862068965
      },
      "text": "(6) A twig, or small switch. Lane. TANACLES. A kind of pincers, used formerly",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06558591549295775,
        "y0": 0.8935672413793103,
        "x1": 0.1283380281690141,
        "y1": 0.9038879310344827
      },
      "text": "p. 162.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04372394366197183,
        "y0": 0.9043551724137932,
        "x1": 0.20121126760563382,
        "y1": 0.9173413793103449
      },
      "text": "TALT. Pitched.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5157718309859155,
        "y0": 0.9159896551724138,
        "x1": 0.925881690140845,
        "y1": 0.9304482758620689
      },
      "text": "for torturing. \"To pinch or tanacle with",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12347887323943663,
        "y0": 0.9186706896551724,
        "x1": 0.36638028169014086,
        "y1": 0.9415965517241379
      },
      "text": "There was talt many pavyloun Of riche sendel and siclatoun.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5165830985915493,
        "y0": 0.9312275862068966,
        "x1": 0.9258760563380282,
        "y1": 0.9433379310344827
      },
      "text": "tongs, with pincers or tanacles,\" Florio,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29715492957746475,
        "y0": 0.9440896551724138,
        "x1": 0.474887323943662,
        "y1": 0.9542620689655172
      },
      "text": "Kt/ug Alisaunder, 5234.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5165830985915493,
        "y0": 0.9452741379310345,
        "x1": 0.6688028169014085,
